<div class="tutorial-path-heading" id="user-guide"><p class="eyebrow">For users</p><h3>Installation & use</h3><p>VideoMAKER has no application build or installer yet. The intended workflow is guided editing of match footage, overlays and horizontal or vertical clips. A hands-on installation and use guide will appear with the first working build.</p></div>

<div class="tutorial-path-heading" id="developer-guide"><p class="eyebrow">For contributors & developers</p><h3>Follow development</h3><p>The <a class="inline-link" href="https://github.com/PlayMAKER-apps/videomaker" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">public VideoMAKER repository ↗</a> is available, but application code and contribution instructions have not been published. You can watch or fork the repository and check its future issues before proposing work. The planned TagMAKER JSON importer should follow the <a class="inline-link" href="https://github.com/PlayMAKER-apps/playmaker-schema" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">shared PlayMAKER data contract ↗</a>; do not include private footage or personal data in public examples.</p></div>
